! Test v1.07.4: the SMEARED-SCF STABILISER on a genuinely metallic
! d-cluster -- the class of system %smearing exists for, and the class
! every earlier revision failed on (see version.inc for the saga).
! Cu3 doublet, HF/LANL2DZ ECP, SAD guess, Fermi sigma = 0.01, and a
! deliberately requested %level_shift 1.0 that MUST be reported as
! disabled ("NOTE: %smearing active -- ... level shift is disabled").
! Checks: (a) the two-phase self-tuning density damping + DIIS
! machinery converges where undamped DIIS diverges by iteration ~6;
! (b) the SAD atomic Cu SCF (d10s1 near-degeneracy) passes under the
! v1.07.4 atomic settings isolation.  PBE analogues: Cu3 38 iters,
! Cu5 59 iters in the validation runs.
! Expected: Total energy (F=E-TS) = -584.99172 +- 2e-5 Ha
! (soft-convergence stop; trajectory-level variation across BLAS and
! stabiliser revisions -- v1.08.0 reference: -584.991716 in 73 iter).
%method  hf
%basis   lanl2dz
%ecp     lanl2dz
%job     energy
%ecp_method   analytical
%initial_guess  sad
%level_shift 1.0
%scf_maxiter    300
%smearing       fermi
%smearing_sigma 0.01
%charge 0
%mult   2
%geo
Cu   0.000000    1.360000    0.000000
Cu   1.177800   -0.680000    0.000000
Cu  -1.177800   -0.680000    0.000000
